<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1849</h1><p class="ref-lede">1849 in world history: 27 events, 17 births, 23 deaths, 1 work, 8 states founded and 9 that came to an end. 1,076 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
