<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/sikh-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sikh%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sikh Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Lord Dalhousie annexes the Punjab after the Second Anglo-Sikh War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-denmark"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Denmark.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Denmark</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Constitution of 5 June ends absolute monarchy</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/austrian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Austrian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Austrian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hungarian forces surrender at Világos after Russian intervention</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/navajo"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Navajo.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Navajo</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Colonel John MacRae Washington leads 400 soldiers into Navajo country and signs a treaty, and the Navajo peace leader Narbona is killed on the way to it</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/giuseppe-garibaldi"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Giuseppe%20Garibaldi.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Giuseppe Garibaldi</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Commands the defence of the Roman Republic against the French and retreats to San Marino; his wife Anita dies near Comacchio</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/harriet-tubman"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Harriet%20Tubman.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Harriet Tubman</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Escapes from slavery to Philadelphia, travelling by night with the help of the Underground Railroad</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/rigveda"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rigveda.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rigveda</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Max Müller publishes a six-volume translation into German</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/lahore"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Lahore.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Lahore</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Punjab is annexed to the British Indian Empire and Lahore becomes the capital of the province</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/karl-marx"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Karl%20Marx.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Karl Marx</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ordered to leave Prussia, expelled from Paris and settled in London, where he remains for the rest of his life</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/unification-of-italy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Unification%20of%20Italy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Unification of Italy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A Roman Republic is proclaimed on 9 February and falls to a French force on 29 June, as Venice surrenders to Austria in August</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/revolutions-of-1848"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Revolutions%20of%201848.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Revolutions of 1848</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">King Frederick William IV of Prussia rejects the imperial crown offered by the Frankfurt National Assembly</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/revolutions-of-1848"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Revolutions%20of%201848.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Revolutions of 1848</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Roman Republic falls to French intervention in July and Venice surrenders in August</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/revolutions-of-1848"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Revolutions%20of%201848.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Revolutions of 1848</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hungary surrenders to Austria and Russia on 13 August, and the fortress of Komárom falls in October</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/pan-slavism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Pan-Slavism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Pan-Slavism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Slovak National Council petitions Emperor Franz Joseph I to recognise the Slovak nation within defined borders</span></li></ul></section>
